### QA scratch (manual smoke-test harnesses, seeds, screenshots — not fixtures) ###
# Mirrors backend/.gitignore's `qa-tmp/` rule. These directories accumulate one per QA pass and
# have never been committed; making that explicit stops a `git add -A` from sweeping them in.
qa-tmp-*/
qa-tmp-*.txt
